      "index": "aw",
      "text": "Each medication is Supported, Contradicted, or Unsupported. Dose, frequency, duration, and timing are checked against the monograph.\nEvery flag quotes the formulary passage (page and section), or states that no relevant passage was retrieved. Critical points are quoted from the primary document.",
